CM_ SG_ 1408 CAPE2_St_KeyIN "Key detected in vehicle，This signal is defined in the message CAPE_02; it show how many keys in vehicle, and which keys locates in:ESCL used key detected signal for column unlockBCM used key detected signal to lock the doors.(only No UID found,1000 0000) if  UID1 and UID2  inside of vehicle, it will be indicated 0011.It will indicate which UIDs are closed in vehicle when any door open transit to all door close. this status shall be store in EEROM. indicate the UIDs in vehicle 0000 0000 = Default value0000 XXX1 = UID 1 is found.0000 XX1X = UID 2 is found0000 X1XX = UID 3 is found  0000 1XXX = UID 4 is found1000 0000=No UID found";
