CM_ SG_ 536 WCBS_ESP7_BrakeTorqOn4Wheels "轮端总的液压制动力矩(EPB除外)按照实际情况发出，不关注车型配置。This signal is the total hydraulic brake torque on 4 weels(except EPB etc.). If current brake torque is over 15000Nm, it will always send the max value 15000Nm. The signal is always sent according to current brake torque, not consider vehicle variant.";
